                        <div id="introduction">
                            <h2 class="section-title">Introduction</h2>
                            <p>The SustainableFashionChain API provides programmatic access to our blockchain-based platform for tracking sustainable cotton and fashion products. This RESTful API allows developers to integrate with our system, accessing information about cotton batches, products, certifications, and tokenization.</p>

                            <div class="alert alert-info">
                                <h5><i class="bi bi-info-circle me-2"></i>Base URL</h5>
                                <p class="mb-0"><code>https://api.sustainablefashionchain.com/api/v1</code></p>
                            </div>

                            <p>All API endpoints are relative to this base URL. For example, to access the batches endpoint, use <code>https://api.sustainablefashionchain.com/api/v1/batches</code>.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div id="authentication">
                            <h2 class="section-title">Authentication</h2>
                            <p>SustainableFashionChain API uses a token-based authentication system. To access protected endpoints, you'll need to include an authorization token in your requests.</p>

                            <div class="auth-card">
                                <h5>Step 1: Obtain API Key</h5>
                                <p>Register for an API key in the <a href="#">developer portal</a>.</p>

                                <h5>Step 2: Request JWT Token</h5>
                                <div class="response-example">
POST /token
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: your_api_key

// Response
{
  "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...",
  "expires_in": 3600,
  "token_type": "Bearer"
}</div>

                                <h5>Step 3: Use JWT Token in Requests</h5>
                                <div class="response-example">
GET /batches
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...</div>
                            </div>

                            <p>Tokens expire after 1 hour. You'll need to request a new token once the current one expires.</p>
                        </div>

                        <div id="batches">
                            <h2 class="section-title">Cotton Batches</h2>
                            <p>Endpoints for managing cotton batches in the supply chain.</p>

                            <!-- GET /batches -->
                            <div class="endpoint-card">
                                <div class="endpoint-header">
                                    <span class="method-badge get-badge">GET</span>
                                    <strong>/batches</strong>
                                </div>
                                <div class="endpoint-body">
                                    <p>Returns a list of all cotton batches in the system.</p>

                                    <h5>Query Parameters</h5>
                                    <table class="param-table">
                                        <thead>
                                            <tr>
                                                <th>Parameter</th>
                                                <th>Type</th>
                                                <th>Description</th>
                                            </tr>
                                        </thead>
                                        <tbody>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>status</td>
                                                <td><span class="param-optional">string</span></td>
                                                <td>Filter by batch status (e.g., Harvested, Processing, Stored)</td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>organic</td>
                                                <td><span class="param-optional">boolean</span></td>
                                                <td>Filter for organic batches (true/false)</td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>fairTrade</td>
                                                <td><span class="param-optional">boolean</span></td>
                                                <td>Filter for fair trade batches (true/false)</td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>farmId</td>
                                                <td><span class="param-optional">string</span></td>
                                                <td>Filter by farm ID</td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>limit</td>
                                                <td><span class="param-optional">integer</span></td>
                                                <td>Maximum number of results (default: 20, max: 100)</td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>offset</td>
                                                <td><span class="param-optional">integer</span></td>
                                                <td>Number of results to skip (for pagination)</td>
                                            </tr>
                                        </tbody>
                                    </table>

                                    <h5>Response Example</h5>
                                    <div class="response-example">
{
  "total": 42,
  "limit": 20,
  "offset": 0,
  "batches": [
    {
      "id": "batch_12345",
      "farmId": "farm_001",
      "quantity": 500,
      "organic": true,
      "fairTrade": true,
      "harvestDate": "2023-04-15T00:00:00Z",
      "location": "Gujarat, India",
      "currentCustody": "warehouse_001",
      "status": "Stored",
      "certifications": ["cert_001", "cert_002"],
      "tokenizationId": "0x1234...",
      "history": [
        {
          "timestamp": "2023-04-15T10:30:00Z",
          "type": "Creation",
          "actor": "farm_001",
          "details": "Cotton batch registered on blockchain"
        },
        // Additional history events...
      ]
    },
    // Additional batches...
  ]
}</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- GET /batches/:id -->
                            <div class="endpoint-card">
                                <div class="endpoint-header">
                                    <span class="method-badge get-badge">GET</span>
                                    <strong>/batches/:id</strong>
                                </div>
                                <div class="endpoint-body">
                                    <p>Returns detailed information about a specific cotton batch.</p>

                                    <h5>Path Parameters</h5>
                                    <table class="param-table">
                                        <thead>
                                            <tr>
                                                <th>Parameter</th>
                                                <th>Type</th>
                                                <th>Description</th>
                                            </tr>
                                        </thead>
                                        <tbody>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>id</td>
                                                <td><span class="param-required">string</span></td>
                                                <td>Unique identifier of the batch</td>
                                            </tr>
                                        </tbody>
                                    </table>

                                    <h5>Response Example</h5>
                                    <div class="response-example">
{
  "id": "batch_12345",
  "farmId": "farm_001",
  "quantity": 500,
  "organic": true,
  "fairTrade": true,
  "harvestDate": "2023-04-15T00:00:00Z",
  "location": "Gujarat, India",
  "currentCustody": "warehouse_001",
  "status": "Stored",
  "certifications": ["cert_001", "cert_002"],
  "tokenizationId": "0x1234...",
  "history": [
    {
      "timestamp": "2023-04-15T10:30:00Z",
      "type": "Creation",
      "actor": "farm_001",
      "details": "Cotton batch registered on blockchain"
    },
    // Additional history events...
  ]
}</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- POST /batches -->
                            <div class="endpoint-card">
                                <div class="endpoint-header">
                                    <span class="method-badge post-badge">POST</span>
                                    <strong>/batches</strong>
                                </div>
                                <div class="endpoint-body">
                                    <p>Creates a new cotton batch in the system.</p>

                                    <h5>Request Parameters</h5>
                                    <table class="param-table">
                                        <thead>
                                            <tr>
                                                <th>Parameter</th>
                                                <th>Type</th>
                                                <th>Description</th>
                                            </tr>
                                        </thead>
                                        <tbody>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>id</td>
                                                <td><span class="param-required">string</span></td>
                                                <td>Unique identifier for the batch</td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>farmID</td>
                                                <td><span class="param-required">string</span></td>
                                                <td>ID of the farm where the cotton was grown</td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>quantity</td>
                                                <td><span class="param-required">number</span></td>
                                                <td>Quantity of cotton in kilograms</td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>organic</td>
                                                <td><span class="param-required">boolean</span></td>
                                                <td>Whether the cotton is organically grown</td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>fairTrade</td>
                                                <td><span class="param-required">boolean</span></td>
                                                <td>Whether the cotton is fair trade certified</td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>harvestDate</td>
                                                <td><span class="param-required">string</span></td>
                                                <td>Date when the cotton was harvested (ISO 8601 format)</td>
                                            </tr>
                                            <tr>
                                                <td>location</td>
                                                <td><span class="param-required">string</span></td>
                                                <td>Geographic location where the cotton was grown</td>
                                            </tr>
                                        </tbody>
                                    </table>

                                    <h5>Request Example</h5>
                                    <div class="response-example">
POST /batches
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9...

{
  "id": "batch_12345",
  "farmID": "farm_001",
  "quantity": 500,
  "organic": true,
  "fairTrade": true,
  "harvestDate": "2023-04-15T00:00:00Z",
  "location": "Gujarat, India"
}</div>

                                    <h5>Response Example</h5>
                                    <div class="response-example">
{
  "message": "Batch created successfully",
  "id": "batch_12345"
}</div>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                        </div>

